Robotics Simulator mesh kit
===========================

Generated kit
-------------
The original OBJ meshes, MTL files, and PNG textures under assets/parts and
assets/textures (except assets/parts/turtlebot3/) were authored for this
project and are released with the repository.

Procedural albedo maps (asphalt, grass, aluminum, rubber, paint, wood, lens)
are original generated noise, not copies of Poly Haven or other libraries.


TurtleBot3 Burger (third-party)
------------------------------
assets/parts/turtlebot3/ contains visual meshes derived from ROBOTIS TurtleBot3:

  Source : https://github.com/ROBOTIS-GIT/turtlebot3
           package turtlebot3_description
  License: Apache License 2.0 (copy in assets/parts/turtlebot3/LICENSE)
  Files  : burger_base, left_tire, right_tire, lds

Modifications (see assets/parts/turtlebot3/NOTICE):
  millimeters to meters, ROS Z-up to Chrono Y-up, AABB-centered, uniformly
  scaled to the existing DiffDrive collision hulls. Physics sizes are unchanged.

TurtleBot3 Burger has no separate licensed caster mesh; the caster visual
stays the generated sphere in this kit.
